id: pm-7f9zkh
title: "GH-1166: root help hides the --all discovery option that reveals the full command surface"
description: "The shipped root --all option works, but compact pm --help omits the option itself, so agents cannot discover how to expand the 14-command core surface to the complete public catalog."
type: Issue
status: closed
priority: 1
tags[5]: agent-ux,"area:cli","area:contracts",github-intake,regression
