author: "harness:codex"
estimated_minutes: 90
acceptance_criteria: pm --help advertises --all without expanding the compact command list; pm --help --json includes --all in root options; pm --all still exposes the complete public surface; a focused regression and process-level acceptance test prevent recurrence
parent: pm-1kxs
risk: medium
confidence: high
severity: medium
repro_steps: Run pm --help and inspect options; run pm --all and compare the expanded command catalog.
resolution: Restored explicit full-surface discovery from compact root help
expected_result: Compact root help remains one screen while advertising --all as the explicit path to the complete public command catalog.
actual_result: "Compact text and JSON root help advertise --all without expanding the compact command tier; pm --all continues to expose the complete public command surface, with unit and process-level regression coverage."
